<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.fleet.gathers ~ the fleet join group, and the act each line names

`lares fleet join` gathers the five acts by which one face's fleet takes a new vessel of the same human, by carried files: `offer` (the face's vessel offers), `request` (the new vessel asks), `answer` (the face answers), `land` (the new vessel lands what it carried) and `abandon` (either side drops the join). Bare, the group names no act and refuses with this account, exit 2; an unknown act refuses the same way, naming the word.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ none

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ names the acts and refuses; nothing moves`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.fleet.offers]] ~ the group names no act, or an act it does not answer; each of offer · request · answer · land · abandon holds its own carrier`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/2 ~ the account of the five acts`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares fleet join

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares fleet join]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

